{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C3\", \"C2\", \"C1\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C2最完整地保住了从暂时松开、享受轻快到轻松退去、重新面对决定的整段因果弧，C3对内心纠缠的刻画更好但略有额外解释，C1则没有充分写出真正侧身离场的过程。keep：C2明确写出他确实顺着轻快走了一段、不急着追问，同时说明轻松退去后难处仍在，并准确唤回S02不再等待、先做能做之事的决定；C3也保留了短暂歇息和决定重现，但问题未解决的表达稍弱；C1主要写出松口气和难处仍在，却没有充分保住那段真实的自由感。cover：C3的几件事纠缠、拿不准方向、越逼自己越恼火，最能解释B1与B3的躁动和失衡，同时也照顾了B2、B4、B5；C2对B1、B2、B4、B5的覆盖尤其完整，但没有触及B3的纠缠感；C1写出了珍惜之物无法自然拥有这一重要痛处，却较难解释短暂离场的活动感。lean：C2各条的心理变化都有明确作用，虽然第二条较长，但没有明显多余的步骤；C3的自我逼迫、纠缠和方向不明略有重叠，第三条的距离感与轻松留不住也稍显重复；C1首条塞入太多变化，第二、三条对失落和难处的交代也有一定重复。plain：C2用往前走、该往哪使劲、顺着轻快过一会儿等日常说法讲清了事情；C3的叙事也比较自然，但几件事纠缠着稍显笼统；C1的珍惜的东西仍不能自然拥有、恼火不甘等表达较压缩，读起来更像归纳心理状态，而不是在讲一件亲身经历的事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b1a00ce5-5709-42f5-be85-9d5c15ea2e9f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T225806235999Z", "elapsed_seconds": 134.765, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:00:20.995570+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "071be1361832f0c07e504ea462a1af4b7f9b3dd5b7c2dccc000148179c346b25", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T225806235999Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "65bc81a19a26df898e0127bf453adadc0b43519f1e98f52b3a1ffa559632660f"}}}
